1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:35,618
[Julio] <i>Even if you</i>
<i>and your mother join forces,</i>

4
00:00:35,702 --> 00:00:39,706
<i>the authorities seized all her assets.</i>

5
00:00:39,789 --> 00:00:42,375
<i>Clearly, Papa, you underestimated Mama.</i>

6
00:00:42,459 --> 00:00:45,670
<i>What the police have</i>
<i>is only the tip of the iceberg.</i>

7
00:00:45,754 --> 00:00:47,505
<i>You know, Red Dragon is more</i>
<i>than what meets the eye.</i>

8
00:00:47,589 --> 00:00:49,132
<i>I will inherit everything Red Dragon owns.</i>

9
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:50,842
<i>All the things that you see and you don't.</i>

10
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:52,177
[Emilia laughing]

11
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,887
[Diego] <i>Looks like it'll</i>
<i>be hard to get in.</i>

12
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:57,515
<i>This place is heavily guarded.</i>
<i>We'll need help from the cops.</i>

13
00:00:57,599 --> 00:00:59,017
[Lily] <i>First, we have to make sure</i>

14
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:01,936
<i>that Red Dragon's money</i>
<i>really is in there.</i>

15
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:06,316
[Julio] <i>You and I have a</i>
<i>common enemy. Lily Cruz.</i>

16
00:01:06,399 --> 00:01:10,820
<i>What if I can tell you</i>
<i>that I can offer you</i>

17
00:01:10,904 --> 00:01:13,698
<i>that alliance against Lily Cruz,</i>

18
00:01:13,782 --> 00:01:19,329
<i>and, most importantly, that I can</i>
<i>guarantee your freedom?</i>

19
00:01:19,913 --> 00:01:21,623
[Emilia] <i>You shouldn't fall for</i>
<i>Papa's trap, you know?</i>

20
00:01:21,706 --> 00:01:24,000
<i>I have a feeling</i>
<i>he needs something from you.</i>

21
00:01:24,083 --> 00:01:26,211
<i>Break time's over. Back to your posts now.</i>

22
00:01:26,294 --> 00:01:29,631
[Lily] <i>It won't be easy to get</i>
<i>to Helena's hidden wealth.</i>

23
00:01:29,714 --> 00:01:32,383
<i>We have to use force. We need manpower.</i>

24
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:33,218
<i>Leave it to me.</i>

25
00:01:33,301 --> 00:01:34,844
[Lily] <i>Myla is gone.</i>

26
00:01:34,928 --> 00:01:37,055
<i>She was the only one left</i>
<i>who could testify for us.</i>

27
00:01:37,138 --> 00:01:39,349
<i>How can I file the case again,</i>

28
00:01:39,432 --> 00:01:41,476
<i>if I don't have anyone</i>
<i>who can testify for me?</i>

29
00:01:41,559 --> 00:01:43,353
<i>I'll testify against Red Dragon.</i>

30
00:01:43,436 --> 00:01:46,940
[Helena] <i>Today, justice is served.</i>
<i>I am not Red Dragon.</i>

31
00:01:47,023 --> 00:01:52,195
<i>And no one can prove I am</i>
<i>that wicked crime leader.</i>

32
00:01:52,278 --> 00:01:54,531
[Lily] <i>Everything I did was for nothing.</i>

33
00:01:56,491 --> 00:01:58,076
Marlon, what about Lily?

34
00:01:58,618 --> 00:02:00,036
[sighs] Let's just give her some space.

35
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,372
She needs some time alone.

36
00:02:03,414 --> 00:02:05,416
[somber music playing]

37
00:02:30,692 --> 00:02:31,693
Jepoy.

38
00:02:54,173 --> 00:02:55,508
[door opening]

39
00:03:11,816 --> 00:03:13,067
Lily.

40
00:03:29,792 --> 00:03:30,877
[Camia sniffles]

41
00:03:38,301 --> 00:03:40,386
What else do I have to do, Mom?

42
00:03:43,097 --> 00:03:45,475
I've done everything I can.

43
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:48,186
I put Arnaldo in prison…

44
00:03:48,269 --> 00:03:50,146
And Emilia too.

45
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:52,357
I took Julio's power from him.

46
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:55,151
And I put Red Dragon behind bars.
But what happened?!

47
00:03:55,693 --> 00:03:58,613
Where did all my effort end up?!

48
00:03:59,864 --> 00:04:00,907
Where?

49
00:04:04,077 --> 00:04:06,829
It all went down the drain.

50
00:04:12,877 --> 00:04:16,130
Lily. I know you did everything you could.

51
00:04:17,298 --> 00:04:19,801
You did everything and more.

52
00:04:21,386 --> 00:04:23,721
So never question your capabilities.

53
00:04:23,805 --> 00:04:24,973
I know!

54
00:04:25,056 --> 00:04:28,434
I don't want to do that, but I have to!

55
00:04:30,228 --> 00:04:33,398
I don't want to give up,
but it's just so exhausting!

56
00:04:36,818 --> 00:04:39,862
Our plans all end up in smoke!

57
00:04:41,781 --> 00:04:43,992
Too many people have sacrificed
so much for this!

58
00:04:44,075 --> 00:04:47,912
Including their lives! But for what?

59
00:04:50,456 --> 00:04:52,292
After I have them locked up,

60
00:04:52,375 --> 00:04:55,169
they'll walk out Scot-free
after a few days.

61
00:04:57,046 --> 00:05:02,719
We exhaust all our efforts
to bring them to justice,

62
00:05:03,594 --> 00:05:07,515
and for what? So we can sit here

63
00:05:08,474 --> 00:05:11,519
and watch them walk away
like nothing happened.

64
00:05:15,690 --> 00:05:17,608
I don't want to give up.

65
00:05:19,444 --> 00:05:20,695
[tense music playing]

66
00:05:20,778 --> 00:05:21,779
[sobbing]

67
00:05:22,155 --> 00:05:25,908
But I'm losing faith
that we can find justice, Mom.

68
00:05:27,076 --> 00:05:32,248
Does justice even exist?
Because I don't think it does.

69
00:05:33,082 --> 00:05:37,295
That's what I feel now.
Justice does not exist.

70
00:05:40,048 --> 00:05:42,091
Because all those criminals

71
00:05:43,176 --> 00:05:45,928
can just use their money to bend the law.

72
00:05:48,598 --> 00:05:52,310
What do I have to do?
What more should I do?

73
00:05:54,312 --> 00:05:59,067
Do the Ardientes want me
to punish them myself

74
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:01,736
and take justice into my own hands?

75
00:06:01,819 --> 00:06:03,529
If that's what they want…

76
00:06:06,824 --> 00:06:08,826
then may Dad forgive me,

77
00:06:08,910 --> 00:06:10,453
but I might just give it to them.

78
00:06:13,081 --> 00:06:14,332
Lily,

79
00:06:15,458 --> 00:06:17,293
since the start we knew that

80
00:06:17,376 --> 00:06:19,921
defeating the enemy wouldn't be easy.

81
00:06:21,589 --> 00:06:24,092
But, no matter how many times we fall,

82
00:06:24,175 --> 00:06:25,760
we always get back up again.

83
00:06:26,969 --> 00:06:30,264
We continue to fight,
and that's what matters.

84
00:06:33,601 --> 00:06:37,772
Your father died to make way
for Lily Cruz.

85
00:06:40,983 --> 00:06:44,278
A Lily Cruz who's ready
to fight for the people.

86
00:06:44,362 --> 00:06:48,574
Because you're the only one
who can take the Ardientes down.

87
00:06:48,658 --> 00:06:49,909
Just you.

88
00:06:55,581 --> 00:06:57,083
Lily, get up.

89
00:06:58,376 --> 00:06:59,669
Get up.

90
00:07:01,921 --> 00:07:04,132
Now isn't the time to give up.

91
00:07:06,175 --> 00:07:10,430
Keep fighting, Lily. Keep fighting!

92
00:07:10,513 --> 00:07:12,473
["Wildflower" instrumental playing]

93
00:07:19,689 --> 00:07:21,190
[breathes deeply]

94
00:07:43,045 --> 00:07:46,591
It keeps draining me,
but I'll keep fighting, Mom.

95
00:07:50,303 --> 00:07:52,346
We won't lose hope.

96
00:07:53,598 --> 00:07:57,393
Because the people of Ardiente
haven't lost hope either.

97
00:07:58,186 --> 00:08:00,188
And, I'm going to make
their dream come true.

98
00:08:00,271 --> 00:08:02,315
["Wildflower" instrumental
continues playing]

99
00:08:39,602 --> 00:08:41,187
Where should I take you, ma'am?

100
00:08:42,939 --> 00:08:44,982
To the place where I truly belong.

101
00:08:54,909 --> 00:08:58,287
Put it there first.
Replace that. Is that good?

102
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:03,751
-Magbanua.
-Governor.

103
00:09:04,794 --> 00:09:06,504
I want you to keep the gates open.

104
00:09:06,587 --> 00:09:08,005
You know the drill.

105
00:09:10,591 --> 00:09:13,678
[chuckles] And you, my grandson,

106
00:09:14,262 --> 00:09:18,849
stay in my office until it's time.

107
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:21,644
Got you, Gramps. See you.

108
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,772
And what are you two whispering about?

109
00:09:25,439 --> 00:09:28,484
Nothing. Um…
it's a good thing you're here.

110
00:09:28,568 --> 00:09:32,238
Um… at least, the family's complete.

111
00:09:32,321 --> 00:09:34,574
What's going on, Papa?
Why do you have this?

112
00:09:34,657 --> 00:09:37,702
Oh, um… one more thing.

113
00:09:37,785 --> 00:09:41,497
I'd like you to put
on your best couture dress

114
00:09:41,581 --> 00:09:43,332
because it's showtime.

115
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:50,298
This is going to be some night.

116
00:09:50,381 --> 00:09:52,592
[slow tense music playing]

117
00:10:02,935 --> 00:10:05,396
<i>We're live at the Ardiente residence,</i>

118
00:10:05,479 --> 00:10:09,275
<i>where a very special guest</i>
<i>from the first family</i>

119
00:10:09,358 --> 00:10:12,111
<i>of Poblacion Ardiente has arrived.</i>

120
00:10:12,194 --> 00:10:14,280
<i>Tonight, the guest of honor</i>

121
00:10:14,363 --> 00:10:18,075
<i>is the light of Julio and Emilia's home.</i>

122
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,577
<i>The light of our town.</i>

123
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:22,830
<i>The one and only, Ms. Helena Montoya.</i>

124
00:10:22,913 --> 00:10:25,207
[tense music playing]

125
00:10:26,626 --> 00:10:28,628
[shutters clicking]

126
00:10:57,239 --> 00:10:59,408
<i>It's a family reunion for all ages,</i>

127
00:10:59,492 --> 00:11:00,951
<i>so stay tuned, everyone,</i>

128
00:11:01,035 --> 00:11:04,246
<i>and let us all join the Ardiente family.</i>

129
00:11:05,956 --> 00:11:07,958
[tense music continues playing]

130
00:11:11,587 --> 00:11:14,507
A very good evening to all of you.

131
00:11:14,590 --> 00:11:15,883
[Julio] <i>Let me just say,</i>

132
00:11:15,966 --> 00:11:21,013
<i>our gathering this evening</i>
<i>is an important event.</i>

133
00:11:21,097 --> 00:11:23,557
<i>Because for the first time,</i>

134
00:11:23,641 --> 00:11:29,980
<i>we will be dining with my beloved…</i>

135
00:11:33,776 --> 00:11:35,027
Helena.

136
00:11:40,533 --> 00:11:43,285
The lovely Helena.

137
00:11:44,286 --> 00:11:47,706
This just proves that the greatest gift

138
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:51,710
that we can receive during the holidays

139
00:11:51,794 --> 00:11:55,089
is knowing our families are whole.

140
00:11:58,592 --> 00:12:02,179
A family that we must defend

141
00:12:02,263 --> 00:12:08,602
<i>fight for, and protect</i>
<i>against malicious people</i>

142
00:12:08,686 --> 00:12:10,146
<i>who aim to tear it down.</i>

143
00:12:11,188 --> 00:12:12,773
As you all know,

144
00:12:13,858 --> 00:12:16,694
for over a century,

145
00:12:16,777 --> 00:12:20,072
it was the Ardiente family
that took care of,

146
00:12:20,156 --> 00:12:24,577
showed love to, and raised all of you.

147
00:12:25,244 --> 00:12:27,496
And we've proven our love to you

148
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:30,458
<i>through our excessive contributions</i>

149
00:12:30,541 --> 00:12:33,711
<i>to infrastructure, education,</i>

150
00:12:34,753 --> 00:12:37,173
land, and housing.

151
00:12:38,174 --> 00:12:39,842
And, of course,

152
00:12:39,925 --> 00:12:44,054
only the best from
your beloved Governor Julio.

153
00:12:47,057 --> 00:12:54,523
It's sad to think that we have
opponents lurking around…

154
00:12:56,484 --> 00:13:02,948
<i>who want to involve our family</i>
<i>in crimes we had nothing to do with.</i>

155
00:13:05,701 --> 00:13:12,416
First of all, they attempted
to bring down my grandson,

156
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:13,792
<i>Mayor Arnaldo.</i>

157
00:13:16,086 --> 00:13:20,216
Unfortunately, he can't be with us tonight

158
00:13:20,299 --> 00:13:22,635
because he is still recovering.

159
00:13:24,303 --> 00:13:25,804
After that,

160
00:13:26,305 --> 00:13:29,975
they proceeded to target
my beloved daughter, Emilia.

161
00:13:30,726 --> 00:13:37,024
They tried to imprison her
with charges that have no basis.

162
00:13:37,691 --> 00:13:40,528
<i>But they weren't content with that,</i>

163
00:13:40,611 --> 00:13:43,364
so they attacked me next.

164
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:45,991
They attempted to overthrow me

165
00:13:46,784 --> 00:13:50,579
as the governor of this province.

166
00:13:51,497 --> 00:13:54,708
Their immorality knows no bounds.

167
00:13:55,084 --> 00:13:59,797
And now, they focused
their eyes on Helena.

168
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,132
And just like Emilia,

169
00:14:02,633 --> 00:14:06,845
<i>they accused her of crimes</i>
<i>without any basis.</i>

170
00:14:08,389 --> 00:14:10,182
Now, let me ask you.

171
00:14:10,933 --> 00:14:18,607
Would you allow those people
to ruin your family

172
00:14:18,691 --> 00:14:22,278
whose only aim is to serve you

173
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:28,826
and ensure your welfare and safety?

174
00:14:28,909 --> 00:14:32,496
Of course not. Especially now
he's back with Helena Montoya.

175
00:14:32,955 --> 00:14:35,082
Wow! They have such a great family.

176
00:14:35,165 --> 00:14:37,293
They should be our role models, right?

177
00:14:37,376 --> 00:14:39,837
What a liar! They're frauds!

178
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,631
He should've said that a family of killers

179
00:14:42,715 --> 00:14:44,174
and thieves have been reunited.

180
00:14:44,258 --> 00:14:47,720
I still think that Helena is Red Dragon.

181
00:14:48,178 --> 00:14:50,723
The Governor just found a way to free her.

182
00:14:50,806 --> 00:14:54,435
Well, good luck to all of us.
It's hopeless.

183
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:57,146
Corruption and murder are here to stay.

184
00:14:57,229 --> 00:14:59,231
Those are what the Ardientes are good at.

185
00:14:59,315 --> 00:15:00,608
You said it!

186
00:15:00,983 --> 00:15:02,610
Be scared of the Ardientes

187
00:15:02,693 --> 00:15:06,614
if you're a criminal,
but if not, you'll be protected.

188
00:15:06,697 --> 00:15:09,074
And they're great leaders.

189
00:15:09,158 --> 00:15:12,286
I mean, you all saw the new
bridge they constructed, right?

190
00:15:12,369 --> 00:15:15,331
The Ardientes do nothing
but help us. Viva Ardiente!

191
00:15:15,414 --> 00:15:16,999
[everyone] Viva Ardiente!

192
00:15:17,082 --> 00:15:19,877
I have great faith

193
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:26,383
that you will join and help us
in fighting these nuisances.

194
00:15:26,467 --> 00:15:30,512
You know what they say,
"Those who scream the loudest,

195
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:34,516
are usually the ones
with the most to hide."

196
00:15:37,186 --> 00:15:40,981
With that said,
could these people be the ones

197
00:15:41,065 --> 00:15:44,985
who are truly responsible
for the crimes they're accusing

198
00:15:45,069 --> 00:15:46,487
our family of?

199
00:15:48,405 --> 00:15:50,115
So for that reason,

200
00:15:50,950 --> 00:15:52,701
we should unite…

201
00:15:53,911 --> 00:15:59,124
to defend and fight for
our beloved province.

202
00:16:08,175 --> 00:16:09,760
Viva Ardiente!

203
00:16:09,843 --> 00:16:12,596
-[all] Viva Ardiente!
-[crowd clapping]

204
00:16:15,182 --> 00:16:16,517
You were right, Mom.

205
00:16:17,184 --> 00:16:18,894
[tense music playing]

206
00:16:18,978 --> 00:16:24,733
I'm the only one
who can topple the Ardientes.

207
00:16:26,485 --> 00:16:29,196
I'll take justice into my own hands.

208
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:32,116
If it's a fight that they want,

209
00:16:33,909 --> 00:16:35,703
then I'll give it to them

210
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:39,665
with the punishment they all deserve.

211
00:16:47,464 --> 00:16:49,466
[tense music swells]

212
00:16:51,301 --> 00:16:56,098
[Julio] Well, thank you very
much to all of you for coming.

213
00:16:56,181 --> 00:16:58,100
It was a pleasure for us.

214
00:16:58,183 --> 00:17:01,186
-Thank you so much.
-Thank you. Merry Christmas.

215
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:04,273
-Viva Ardiente!
-[everyone] Viva Ardiente!

216
00:17:04,857 --> 00:17:07,234
Thank you. Let us see you all out.

217
00:17:13,991 --> 00:17:15,200
Bye. Good night.

218
00:17:15,284 --> 00:17:17,703
Good night. Remember to drive safely.

219
00:17:17,786 --> 00:17:18,996
Night.

220
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:20,998
Be careful on your way home.

221
00:17:23,709 --> 00:17:25,335
-[Arnaldo clapping]
-[ominous music playing]

222
00:17:27,171 --> 00:17:34,094
And the best ensemble goes to…
the Ardiente family.

223
00:17:34,178 --> 00:17:36,972
-[Julio and Arnaldo chuckle]
-Great acting, everyone.

224
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:38,390
Thank you.

225
00:17:38,474 --> 00:17:40,517
How the hell did it happen, huh?

226
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:42,269
Emilia.

227
00:17:42,811 --> 00:17:45,856
Mama, you told me
that no matter what happens,

228
00:17:45,939 --> 00:17:48,525
you will never accept any help from Papa.

229
00:17:48,609 --> 00:17:51,070
But here you are,
allying yourself with him.

230
00:17:51,695 --> 00:17:53,864
Shut your mouth, Emilia.

231
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:59,703
Look. I helped your mother
get out of prison.

232
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:01,205
Do you have a problem with that?

233
00:18:01,288 --> 00:18:02,372
How?

234
00:18:08,796 --> 00:18:10,297
[knocking on door]

235
00:18:13,175 --> 00:18:15,177
[suspenseful music playing]

236
00:18:25,437 --> 00:18:26,396
[thuds]

237
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:29,191
[grunts]

238
00:18:41,912 --> 00:18:46,917
<i>Pick one, your call. Money or your life?</i>

239
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,669
[tense music playing]

240
00:18:51,922 --> 00:18:53,465
<i>I don't plan on dying yet.</i>

241
00:18:53,799 --> 00:18:54,883
[scoffs]

242
00:19:09,273 --> 00:19:11,191
THERE'S A HOUSE FOR YOU IN BITAC.
DON'T COME BACK HERE AGAIN.

243
00:19:21,577 --> 00:19:24,663
[Mateo] <i>Let go of me! Let me go!</i>

244
00:19:28,584 --> 00:19:29,459
[grunts]

245
00:19:29,543 --> 00:19:31,420
[Mateo panting]

246
00:19:32,379 --> 00:19:36,008
[Mateo] <i>Julio Ardiente.</i>
<i>Why are you doing this to me?</i>

247
00:19:36,091 --> 00:19:37,885
<i>I didn't betray Red Dragon.</i>

248
00:19:40,179 --> 00:19:42,931
<i>But then, you betrayed me.</i>

249
00:19:45,601 --> 00:19:47,019
[grunts]

250
00:19:48,103 --> 00:19:49,479
<i>You know, Mateo.</i>

251
00:19:51,857 --> 00:19:53,859
<i>You are a wild card.</i>

252
00:19:54,943 --> 00:19:56,862
<i>You can betray Red Dragon solely</i>

253
00:19:56,945 --> 00:20:00,699
<i>because of your hatred for me.</i>
<i>I know that.</i>

254
00:20:04,703 --> 00:20:05,913
[grunts]

255
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:09,583
<i>Julio Ardiente, I won't do that.</i>

256
00:20:09,666 --> 00:20:11,501
<i>Why are you doing this?</i>

257
00:20:15,464 --> 00:20:21,178
<i>Mateo. Don't you see how</i>
<i>magnanimous I'm trying to be?</i>

258
00:20:21,595 --> 00:20:23,680
<i>I'm giving you a chance to live!</i>

259
00:20:23,972 --> 00:20:28,018
<i>Leave Poblacion Ardiente</i>
<i>and never look back!</i>

260
00:20:28,101 --> 00:20:30,479
<i>Because if you do, the only</i>
<i>welcoming party you'll get</i>

261
00:20:30,562 --> 00:20:32,564
<i>is a bullet from me.</i>

262
00:20:34,066 --> 00:20:35,776
<i>Hasta la vista, Señor.</i>

263
00:20:37,236 --> 00:20:39,529
<i>I told you never to get on my bad side.</i>

264
00:20:40,155 --> 00:20:42,491
[Mateo grunts]

265
00:20:43,492 --> 00:20:45,452
<i>Judge Lustre already did</i>
<i>a huge favor for you.</i>

266
00:20:46,161 --> 00:20:48,580
<i>What you're asking for</i>
<i>is no easy task, Julio.</i>

267
00:21:00,926 --> 00:21:03,262
<i>How about this?</i>

268
00:21:04,388 --> 00:21:10,060
<i>Is a billion pesos asking nicely enough?</i>

269
00:21:23,073 --> 00:21:25,450
I'm pretty sure you used
the people's money

270
00:21:25,534 --> 00:21:27,577
to pay off that judge, Papa.

271
00:21:27,661 --> 00:21:30,706
Now, I want to know, how do you
plan on giving it back?

272
00:21:30,789 --> 00:21:35,877
I don't plan on giving a single cent back.

273
00:21:36,461 --> 00:21:42,801
But, I expect Helena to pay me

274
00:21:42,884 --> 00:21:45,387
as a form of gratitude for my efforts

275
00:21:45,470 --> 00:21:47,472
in getting her out of prison.

276
00:21:48,348 --> 00:21:52,477
I mean, one billion pesos
isn't much for her, anyway.

277
00:21:53,562 --> 00:21:58,608
That's right, Julio.
That amount isn't much for me.

278
00:21:58,692 --> 00:22:02,446
And one day, I'll pay you
back down to the last cent.

279
00:22:03,196 --> 00:22:05,657
-What?
-Oh, is that so?

280
00:22:06,283 --> 00:22:10,787
Well then, we'll carry on
with this charade

281
00:22:10,871 --> 00:22:18,170
until you've paid me no less
than one billion pesos in cash.

282
00:22:18,253 --> 00:22:23,592
In the meantime, we'll have to keep on

283
00:22:23,675 --> 00:22:28,972
making the people think
we're one big happy family.

284
00:22:29,056 --> 00:22:30,348
-Ew.
-[Julio chuckles]

285
00:22:30,432 --> 00:22:32,434
-Why?
-Well, Julio.

286
00:22:32,517 --> 00:22:34,102
-Yes?
-You've got me where you want me.

287
00:22:34,186 --> 00:22:36,980
-Disgusting. I'm leaving.
-I'm not going anywhere.

288
00:22:37,773 --> 00:22:39,941
Stop whispering in my ear.

289
00:22:43,570 --> 00:22:44,905
Flirt!

290
00:22:50,994 --> 00:22:51,912
What?

291
00:22:52,162 --> 00:22:55,123
-Ah… nothing.
-Nothing, really?

292
00:22:55,207 --> 00:22:57,000
I don't like that look on your face.

293
00:22:57,084 --> 00:22:58,502
[Arnaldo chuckles]

294
00:22:58,585 --> 00:23:02,172
What are you trying to…
What are you trying to imply?

295
00:23:02,255 --> 00:23:03,006
Huh?

296
00:23:03,256 --> 00:23:05,258
I'm just saying we have a plan.

297
00:23:06,843 --> 00:23:08,845
[suspenseful music playing]

298
00:23:11,264 --> 00:23:12,474
Boss Jaguar,

299
00:23:12,974 --> 00:23:15,685
Red Dragon and the Ardientes
are working together now.

300
00:23:16,186 --> 00:23:17,854
Are you sure Red Dragon and Helena Montoya

301
00:23:17,938 --> 00:23:19,397
are the same person?

302
00:23:20,857 --> 00:23:23,485
Come on. It's like you
don't know the Ardientes.

303
00:23:23,568 --> 00:23:26,488
I bet the governor already
cleared Helena Montoya's name

304
00:23:27,364 --> 00:23:31,159
so that when the time comes,
they'll be on the same side.

305
00:23:33,161 --> 00:23:35,038
What's your plan now, Boss Jaguar?

306
00:23:35,872 --> 00:23:39,334
The Ardientes have become more powerful
with Red Dragon on their side.

307
00:23:39,918 --> 00:23:41,711
Our operations are at risk here.

308
00:23:42,379 --> 00:23:46,174
I mean, we're nothing compared
to that enormous group.

309
00:23:46,258 --> 00:23:51,179
Boss, shouldn't we be
joining their group now?

310
00:23:52,639 --> 00:23:54,641
[tense music playing]

311
00:23:56,059 --> 00:24:01,189
This group was formed to take
on the Ardientes.

312
00:24:02,566 --> 00:24:04,568
So, don't you worry.

313
00:24:07,154 --> 00:24:08,905
We'll bring them down.

314
00:24:19,583 --> 00:24:21,585
[pensive music playing]

315
00:24:34,973 --> 00:24:38,560
[Lily] <i>I know you bombed my properties!</i>

316
00:24:38,643 --> 00:24:42,522
<i>An eye for an eye, Red Dragon.</i>

317
00:24:42,606 --> 00:24:46,568
<i>The jig is up because right now,</i>

318
00:24:46,651 --> 00:24:53,658
<i>everyone knows that Helena Montoya</i>
<i>is none other than Red Dragon.</i>

319
00:24:55,493 --> 00:24:57,704
[helicopter blades whirring]

320
00:25:02,834 --> 00:25:03,793
<i>Got you.</i>

321
00:25:03,877 --> 00:25:06,504
<i>Caught you red-handed, Red Dragon.</i>

322
00:25:14,179 --> 00:25:16,514
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" playing]

323
00:25:19,476 --> 00:25:20,477
[knocking]

324
00:25:44,167 --> 00:25:45,919
You know, when I was a kid…

325
00:25:47,921 --> 00:25:50,340
people would pick fights
and gang up on me.

326
00:25:52,968 --> 00:25:55,220
Then, I met this little girl.

327
00:25:59,057 --> 00:26:04,187
She was beautiful, smart, and most of all,

328
00:26:06,022 --> 00:26:07,399
brave.

329
00:26:11,778 --> 00:26:14,281
She taught me how to fight back.

330
00:26:20,996 --> 00:26:22,038
Lily…

331
00:26:27,877 --> 00:26:29,796
You have to be strong.

332
00:26:32,799 --> 00:26:33,925
And I'm right here.

333
00:26:35,176 --> 00:26:38,305
Even if the whole world
conspires against you,

334
00:26:39,723 --> 00:26:41,641
I'll stay and stand up to them with you.

335
00:26:43,268 --> 00:26:44,477
Just the two of us.

336
00:26:45,353 --> 00:26:48,356
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" continues playing]

337
00:27:22,390 --> 00:27:24,392
[ominous music playing]

338
00:27:29,481 --> 00:27:31,316
Damn those Ardientes.

339
00:27:33,193 --> 00:27:34,986
Damn every one of them.

340
00:27:36,237 --> 00:27:39,074
My daughter has gone through so much.

341
00:27:39,866 --> 00:27:42,911
She's risked her whole life
to capture them.

342
00:27:44,579 --> 00:27:46,414
As her mother, I feel so helpless,

343
00:27:46,498 --> 00:27:49,042
like I can't do anything for her.

344
00:27:51,836 --> 00:27:53,922
But I won't let her see that, Damian.

345
00:27:54,964 --> 00:27:57,175
Because what she needs now,

346
00:27:58,051 --> 00:28:00,929
is a mother who's ready
to fight by her side,

347
00:28:02,514 --> 00:28:04,307
no matter what happens.

348
00:28:06,393 --> 00:28:08,395
I'm here for Lily too.

349
00:28:09,479 --> 00:28:11,648
I'll be here for both of you,
no matter what.

350
00:28:23,034 --> 00:28:24,577
[tense music playing]

351
00:28:38,800 --> 00:28:40,260
Emilia, let's talk for a sec.

352
00:28:41,803 --> 00:28:44,431
-Emilia, stop, we need to talk.
-What now?!

353
00:28:44,514 --> 00:28:46,099
It's not like there's
anything else to talk about.

354
00:28:46,182 --> 00:28:47,642
Yes, there is!

355
00:28:48,977 --> 00:28:51,479
Just what am I to this family, huh?

356
00:28:51,563 --> 00:28:53,273
You've been keeping me out of the loop!

357
00:28:53,356 --> 00:28:56,776
I had to find out that your
mother was Red Dragon on my own

358
00:28:56,860 --> 00:28:59,237
when you could've just told me.
So, why didn't you?

359
00:29:04,367 --> 00:29:06,828
Well, Raul, have you ever done
anything to prove

360
00:29:06,911 --> 00:29:09,247
your worth to this family? You haven't!

361
00:29:09,330 --> 00:29:12,292
You are a liability, Raul.
So, just shut up because

362
00:29:12,375 --> 00:29:15,545
it's not like you're doing
anything useful at all.

363
00:29:19,174 --> 00:29:22,343
Looks like your father's
pestering your mother again.

364
00:29:23,928 --> 00:29:25,513
And why is that?

365
00:29:26,723 --> 00:29:30,185
Well, even all of Ardiente
knows just how much money

366
00:29:30,268 --> 00:29:31,186
is involved now

367
00:29:31,269 --> 00:29:34,147
that your grandmother
and I have joined forces.

368
00:29:35,106 --> 00:29:35,940
[scoffs]

369
00:29:36,024 --> 00:29:38,985
And let me guess,
he wants a piece of the pie.

370
00:29:39,068 --> 00:29:40,320
[Julio chuckles]

371
00:29:40,403 --> 00:29:47,494
Exactly. Your father wants
to get a cut of that money.

372
00:29:49,204 --> 00:29:51,956
He wants to have his own little share.

373
00:29:52,332 --> 00:29:55,752
But I can't let that happen.
He's nothing but a nuisance.

374
00:29:55,835 --> 00:30:00,715
Which means we have to make sure
that the money stays between us.

375
00:30:00,799 --> 00:30:04,636
So, we better do something about it

376
00:30:05,386 --> 00:30:09,265
before he manages to outwit
your poor mother again.

377
00:30:09,349 --> 00:30:13,394
Okay. I'm… I'm game. What's the plan?

378
00:30:13,770 --> 00:30:15,146
[chuckles]

379
00:30:32,080 --> 00:30:34,916
[Raul] <i>You can't fool me.</i>
<i>I'll find out about your plans</i>

380
00:30:34,999 --> 00:30:37,836
<i>one way or another, you bastards.</i>

381
00:30:41,297 --> 00:30:43,299
[tense music playing]

382
00:31:10,910 --> 00:31:13,288
We couldn't get the court
to release a search warrant.

383
00:31:14,455 --> 00:31:15,498
What?

384
00:31:16,666 --> 00:31:18,960
Wasn't the evidence we presented enough?

385
00:31:19,335 --> 00:31:20,503
Have they gone blind?

386
00:31:20,587 --> 00:31:23,006
Helena Montoya's hidden wealth
is right there.

387
00:31:23,715 --> 00:31:27,176
There's nothing we can do.
All her accounts are clean.

388
00:31:27,260 --> 00:31:30,096
And I can only move
with the judge's permission.

389
00:31:30,179 --> 00:31:31,180
Judge?

390
00:31:31,681 --> 00:31:33,892
Don't you realize that
the Ardientes have all the courts

391
00:31:33,975 --> 00:31:36,227
in the palm of their hands?

392
00:31:36,311 --> 00:31:38,563
So, if you're just going
to let yourselves be used,

393
00:31:38,646 --> 00:31:39,981
then what else are you here for?

394
00:31:40,648 --> 00:31:42,567
I am not a vigilante.

395
00:31:42,650 --> 00:31:45,862
It's my job to make sure
the law is enforced,

396
00:31:45,945 --> 00:31:47,155
regardless of how I feel about it.

397
00:31:47,238 --> 00:31:48,489
Enough.

398
00:31:51,659 --> 00:31:55,330
It's fine, Agent Salonga.
I'll just give you another call.

399
00:32:03,963 --> 00:32:06,049
[vehicle starting]

400
00:32:10,762 --> 00:32:12,764
[car engine revving]

401
00:32:14,057 --> 00:32:15,850
I bet the Ardientes found out

402
00:32:15,934 --> 00:32:18,519
that we're after
Helena Montoya's hidden wealth.

403
00:32:18,853 --> 00:32:20,146
Now, they're going to secure her wealth.

404
00:32:20,229 --> 00:32:22,190
What do we do if they succeed?

405
00:32:22,273 --> 00:32:24,692
I'm not part of
Red Dragon's syndicate anymore.

406
00:32:24,776 --> 00:32:27,695
There's still one thing we can try, Diego.

407
00:32:28,780 --> 00:32:32,492
There's no way I'm letting the
Ardientes get all that money.

408
00:32:32,575 --> 00:32:35,703
Truth is, those were funds
stolen from the people.

409
00:32:35,787 --> 00:32:39,165
And now, I bet they're going to
use that money to stay in power.

410
00:32:40,375 --> 00:32:44,003
So, if the law enforcers
can't do anything about it,

411
00:32:45,046 --> 00:32:50,176
then I guess
we'll have to do things my way.

412
00:32:51,970 --> 00:32:53,471
[tense music playing]

413
00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:06,776
-Stay right there, sir.
-Wait, I just want to talk to…

414
00:33:06,859 --> 00:33:09,487
Hey, why won't you let me?!
Out of my way! Now!

415
00:33:11,531 --> 00:33:13,741
[grunts]

416
00:33:21,874 --> 00:33:23,418
[Colonel Magbanua]
Give me a reason to shoot!

417
00:33:27,088 --> 00:33:28,923
Papa, why are you doing this?

418
00:33:30,258 --> 00:33:31,217
Raul.

419
00:33:31,801 --> 00:33:34,012
-[Raul panting]
-Bring him closer to me.

420
00:33:34,804 --> 00:33:38,307
Raul, quit playing dumb already.

421
00:33:39,809 --> 00:33:43,855
I know you're bothering us
because you want to get

422
00:33:43,938 --> 00:33:46,524
a share of the money we'll be getting.

423
00:33:46,607 --> 00:33:49,110
What the hell are you talking about?
I don't care about that!

424
00:33:49,193 --> 00:33:51,070
This is what I don't like about you.

425
00:33:51,154 --> 00:33:52,989
You're insulting my intelligence.

426
00:33:53,072 --> 00:33:56,701
There's too much money
at stake here for a moron

427
00:33:56,784 --> 00:33:59,287
like you to get involved.

428
00:33:59,370 --> 00:34:02,832
So from this day forward,
I'm disowning you,

429
00:34:02,915 --> 00:34:05,960
which means you no longer have
anything to do with my family!

430
00:34:07,086 --> 00:34:10,965
Well, it looks like I need to remind you,

431
00:34:12,258 --> 00:34:13,176
that there's no way that's happening

432
00:34:13,259 --> 00:34:16,387
because, first of all,
I'm your daughter's husband.

433
00:34:17,513 --> 00:34:21,434
And that boy over there
is my son. Your grandson.

434
00:34:21,517 --> 00:34:22,727
Mhm. I'm aware.

435
00:34:22,810 --> 00:34:25,938
Besides, you know you owe a lot to my dad.

436
00:34:26,439 --> 00:34:29,400
You're an ungrateful bastard.
You know that?

437
00:34:29,484 --> 00:34:33,362
Actually, that's really
the only thing you have on me.

438
00:34:33,446 --> 00:34:36,866
Didn't I tell you I should've
finished you off ages ago?

439
00:34:36,949 --> 00:34:39,869
Except I owed a great deal to your father,

440
00:34:39,952 --> 00:34:42,705
and that's the only reason
why you're still alive.

441
00:34:42,789 --> 00:34:45,374
But, I can also have you killed
right this very second.

442
00:34:45,458 --> 00:34:50,463
Because, first of all,
you're a worthless husband.

443
00:34:51,464 --> 00:34:57,095
And, you're a useless father
to this amazing boy over here,

444
00:34:57,428 --> 00:34:59,388
who just happens to be related to you.

445
00:34:59,972 --> 00:35:04,685
That said, no one's going to
care if I have you killed.

446
00:35:04,769 --> 00:35:06,104
Because no one gives a damn about you!

447
00:35:06,187 --> 00:35:07,105
[grunts]

448
00:35:08,981 --> 00:35:11,067
Remember this, you bastard.

449
00:35:11,484 --> 00:35:14,028
I almost died that day
because of what you did!

450
00:35:14,112 --> 00:35:16,864
-I know.
-And I've never forgotten!

451
00:35:16,948 --> 00:35:18,699
So this is my revenge!

452
00:35:19,325 --> 00:35:21,202
[tense music playing]

453
00:35:21,369 --> 00:35:22,703
Now, scram!

454
00:35:23,037 --> 00:35:26,332
You're lucky I still know
how to respect my elders.

455
00:35:27,375 --> 00:35:29,043
Well, you better.

456
00:35:29,710 --> 00:35:31,963
-Let's go!
-[Julio] You worthless moron!

457
00:35:32,046 --> 00:35:33,005
Let go of me!

458
00:35:33,089 --> 00:35:34,757
-[Arnaldo giggling]
-What a blockhead.

459
00:35:34,841 --> 00:35:36,509
He makes my blood boil.

460
00:35:42,807 --> 00:35:44,433
[Raul] <i>Your dad was right, Raul.</i>

461
00:35:46,060 --> 00:35:48,729
<i>You threw your life away choosing Emilia.</i>

462
00:35:49,897 --> 00:35:51,482
<i>You stuck with her family</i>

463
00:35:52,567 --> 00:35:54,902
<i>because you wanted a share of their power.</i>

464
00:35:55,903 --> 00:35:59,282
<i>Because you're a loser. A loser!</i>

465
00:36:05,288 --> 00:36:10,209
Helena and her cheap tactics!

466
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:15,882
I know she has the money,
but she keeps playing coy.

467
00:36:15,965 --> 00:36:18,718
Well, if that's the case, she's smooth.

468
00:36:19,927 --> 00:36:22,930
She's discreetly trying to outsmart you.

469
00:36:23,014 --> 00:36:23,848
[Julio grunts]

470
00:36:25,516 --> 00:36:26,475
But…

471
00:36:29,896 --> 00:36:32,231
I know how you can get even.

472
00:36:33,149 --> 00:36:36,986
I know what you're implying. I know.

473
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,988
The problem is,

474
00:36:39,864 --> 00:36:45,661
we don't know the exact location
of the damn treasure.

475
00:36:47,455 --> 00:36:48,331
Okay.

476
00:36:50,124 --> 00:36:52,501
Who's the person
that grandma trusts the most?

477
00:36:52,585 --> 00:36:53,502
Isn't it Mom?

478
00:36:54,045 --> 00:36:55,630
-Yeah.
-Now think about this.

479
00:36:55,713 --> 00:36:57,548
Who does Mom trust the most?

480
00:37:02,011 --> 00:37:03,012
You.

481
00:37:07,308 --> 00:37:09,393
Emilia, my dear.

482
00:37:09,477 --> 00:37:11,395
Let's get this over with, shall we?

483
00:37:11,479 --> 00:37:12,688
I know something's bothering you,

484
00:37:12,772 --> 00:37:15,942
but I don't know what it is.
What is it? Tell me.

485
00:37:16,025 --> 00:37:19,403
As if you have no idea
why I'm bothered, Mama.

486
00:37:19,904 --> 00:37:22,740
I'm sure the decision you made
kept you up all night.

487
00:37:22,823 --> 00:37:25,868
I know I may have made a deal
with the devil.

488
00:37:26,577 --> 00:37:29,288
And I know that your Papa
is not to be trusted.

489
00:37:29,372 --> 00:37:31,082
I only did that to get out of jail.

490
00:37:31,165 --> 00:37:35,086
And now that I'm free,
it only means that we can go on

491
00:37:35,169 --> 00:37:38,422
with our plans to rebuild my kingdom.

492
00:37:38,506 --> 00:37:41,717
You and me, together. Isn't that great?

493
00:37:41,801 --> 00:37:44,178
[sighs] I'm just here
to protect you, Mama.

494
00:37:44,262 --> 00:37:48,182
Because I have a strong feeling
that Papa will double-cross you.

495
00:37:48,266 --> 00:37:50,309
I know that he's not to be trusted.

496
00:37:51,227 --> 00:37:53,980
That's why now,

497
00:37:54,563 --> 00:37:58,734
I'm going to make you the
protector of my hidden wealth.

498
00:38:00,653 --> 00:38:03,781
I want you to go to the site.
Do everything that you can.

499
00:38:03,864 --> 00:38:06,492
Check the security. Do whatever you can.

500
00:38:06,575 --> 00:38:09,078
Just guard it with your life.

501
00:38:13,082 --> 00:38:17,461
[Arnaldo] Having said that,
the only way to the treasure

502
00:38:17,545 --> 00:38:19,714
is through Grandma's princess.

503
00:38:22,967 --> 00:38:24,552
So, I'll keep an eye on them.

504
00:38:25,678 --> 00:38:28,389
-Mom, specifically.
-No, no, no, no, no.

505
00:38:29,682 --> 00:38:33,269
I don't want them
to lose their trust in you.

506
00:38:34,562 --> 00:38:38,065
I want you to go on spying,
but not on them.

507
00:38:38,774 --> 00:38:42,069
Instead, you should keep
your eyes on Lily's group.

508
00:38:44,113 --> 00:38:48,659
I know the right person
who can spy on your mother.

509
00:38:48,743 --> 00:38:50,119
[suspenseful music playing]

510
00:38:51,787 --> 00:38:52,788
[scoffs]

511
00:38:53,372 --> 00:38:54,707
I know.

512
00:38:54,790 --> 00:38:57,626
Okay. Well, in case you change
your mind, I'm here.

513
00:39:01,213 --> 00:39:05,009
[chuckles] I… love it, Mama!

514
00:39:05,092 --> 00:39:09,805
But, um, can I ask help
from my one and only protector?

515
00:39:09,889 --> 00:39:10,890
Who?

516
00:39:11,265 --> 00:39:13,184
My pet cat, Jaguar.

517
00:39:13,934 --> 00:39:15,686
I'm sorry, Emilia. No.

518
00:39:15,770 --> 00:39:16,854
But… but why?

519
00:39:16,937 --> 00:39:20,900
You might end up with the wrong
Jaguar, the original Jaguar.

520
00:39:20,983 --> 00:39:23,652
Well, that's better, Mama,
because he's one of your men.

521
00:39:25,154 --> 00:39:26,238
We can't trust him.

522
00:39:27,365 --> 00:39:29,867
There's a lot of things
you don't know about him.

523
00:39:30,368 --> 00:39:32,244
Well, if that's the case, Mama,
why don't you

524
00:39:32,328 --> 00:39:34,205
just have him killed, like what you did

525
00:39:34,288 --> 00:39:36,374
to a certain traitor
who tried to go against me?

526
00:39:36,624 --> 00:39:38,584
Because the original Jaguar
has connections

527
00:39:38,667 --> 00:39:41,921
with our enemies. I can still use him.

528
00:39:43,589 --> 00:39:47,426
Soon, you will understand
what I'm talking about.

529
00:39:47,510 --> 00:39:50,721
But, for now, you have got to trust me.

530
00:39:53,766 --> 00:39:55,476
[suspenseful music playing]

531
00:39:59,772 --> 00:40:03,484
Just as we planned,
we'll go through the back.

532
00:40:04,360 --> 00:40:07,405
But, once we get our hands
on Helena's fortune,

533
00:40:07,488 --> 00:40:09,907
we can't surrender it to the authorities.

534
00:40:09,990 --> 00:40:11,367
The Ardientes are in power,

535
00:40:11,450 --> 00:40:13,702
and I'm sure they'd all just get it back.

536
00:40:15,287 --> 00:40:18,374
All right. We won't surrender it.

537
00:40:21,001 --> 00:40:23,838
We'll destroy all of Helena
Montoya's brothels,

538
00:40:23,921 --> 00:40:28,968
remaining firearms,
and other illegal businesses

539
00:40:29,051 --> 00:40:31,804
that are corrupting the town of Ardiente.

540
00:40:32,638 --> 00:40:34,932
We'll destroy all of it.

541
00:40:39,145 --> 00:40:41,147
[tense music swells]

542
00:40:42,022 --> 00:40:43,607
Okay, I'll see you later, Anna.

543
00:40:43,691 --> 00:40:44,650
-Sure.
-Good night.

544
00:40:44,733 --> 00:40:45,734
Take care.

545
00:40:47,069 --> 00:40:49,071
[crickets chirping]

546
00:40:57,663 --> 00:40:59,373
Anna, can we talk?

547
00:41:06,130 --> 00:41:07,923
I know I made a mistake.

548
00:41:09,842 --> 00:41:12,219
And, I want to ask for your forgiveness.

549
00:41:12,303 --> 00:41:14,013
I didn't mean to hurt you.

550
00:41:14,763 --> 00:41:16,765
[dramatic music playing]

551
00:41:18,726 --> 00:41:20,561
Please give me another chance.

552
00:41:23,772 --> 00:41:27,401
Anna, talk to me. I'm going crazy here.

553
00:41:27,485 --> 00:41:28,694
There's nothing else to talk about.

554
00:41:28,777 --> 00:41:30,154
Anna, wait.

555
00:41:32,156 --> 00:41:33,782
Is this it for us?

556
00:41:36,285 --> 00:41:39,121
Anna, I know I hurt you. [breathes deeply]

557
00:41:40,915 --> 00:41:42,708
And that's why I want to apologize.

558
00:41:48,255 --> 00:41:49,757
Besides, what's up with that?

559
00:41:51,467 --> 00:41:53,886
I'm gone for one second
and now you have Marlon?

560
00:41:55,971 --> 00:41:58,307
What on earth are you
talking about, Jepoy?

561
00:41:58,766 --> 00:42:00,476
Marlon and I are just friends.

562
00:42:01,852 --> 00:42:03,521
And besides, you of all people

563
00:42:03,604 --> 00:42:07,024
should know you don't have
the right to ask anymore.

564
00:42:07,775 --> 00:42:10,277
That you don't have the right
to care about my decisions

565
00:42:10,361 --> 00:42:11,904
because we're through.

566
00:42:12,404 --> 00:42:13,948
Anna, I loved you.

567
00:42:15,366 --> 00:42:18,202
And, I still do, so please forgive me.

568
00:42:19,161 --> 00:42:20,162
Give me another--

569
00:42:20,746 --> 00:42:24,500
Love?! You should've thought of that

570
00:42:24,583 --> 00:42:26,919
while you were enjoying yourself
with Natalie.

571
00:42:28,420 --> 00:42:29,755
Because if you really loved me,

572
00:42:29,838 --> 00:42:32,174
you wouldn't have done that, Jepoy.

573
00:42:33,551 --> 00:42:35,970
You wouldn't have been able
to hurt me like that.

574
00:42:37,471 --> 00:42:40,182
Sorry. Anna, sorry.

575
00:42:43,852 --> 00:42:44,770
I'm sorry.

576
00:42:45,145 --> 00:42:46,564
I am too, Lily.

577
00:42:47,648 --> 00:42:49,400
I know you really need my support,

578
00:42:49,483 --> 00:42:51,443
but I have to stay in town for now.

579
00:42:53,070 --> 00:42:54,697
I understand.

580
00:42:58,576 --> 00:43:00,619
[somber music playing]

581
00:43:08,085 --> 00:43:12,506
I thought you and Anna
just had a small disagreement.

582
00:43:15,509 --> 00:43:17,469
But it was actually pretty serious.

583
00:43:21,599 --> 00:43:23,851
Jepoy, I think you know

584
00:43:23,934 --> 00:43:26,061
that what you did was wrong
on every level,

585
00:43:26,145 --> 00:43:28,272
so you need to be more patient.

586
00:43:31,275 --> 00:43:33,902
You should get some rest.

587
00:43:35,070 --> 00:43:37,406
Come back when you're ready.

588
00:43:37,489 --> 00:43:39,742
I'm going to need you
for when we fight again.

589
00:43:42,077 --> 00:43:43,454
And when I say "get some rest",

590
00:43:43,537 --> 00:43:48,042
that doesn't mean with other women.

591
00:43:50,711 --> 00:43:52,588
I hope that's clear.

592
00:43:55,049 --> 00:43:56,216
Now, go.

593
00:44:15,611 --> 00:44:18,906
[sighs] I've done everything
I can to help my daughter.

594
00:44:22,368 --> 00:44:23,952
[breathes deeply]

595
00:44:24,662 --> 00:44:26,205
But it never ends.

596
00:44:30,793 --> 00:44:33,295
And, this battle is wearing
my daughter down.

597
00:44:35,255 --> 00:44:36,882
But, I hope…

598
00:44:38,717 --> 00:44:41,804
I hope you can give me the
strength to keep supporting her.

599
00:44:41,887 --> 00:44:44,306
I wish there was still something
I could do for her.

600
00:44:44,390 --> 00:44:46,183
I wish I could find another way to help.

601
00:44:47,685 --> 00:44:49,645
[dramatic music playing]

602
00:45:10,916 --> 00:45:13,419
Jepoy, be careful, okay?

603
00:45:13,502 --> 00:45:16,213
Make sure no civilian gets hurt

604
00:45:16,296 --> 00:45:18,507
when you get to the armory
and the brothel.

605
00:45:18,590 --> 00:45:20,175
I will. You can count on me.

606
00:45:20,926 --> 00:45:24,805
We'll make Helena regret
she ever got out of prison.

607
00:45:25,931 --> 00:45:29,268
All right, go. Text me once you get there.

608
00:45:29,351 --> 00:45:30,436
Got it.

609
00:45:31,603 --> 00:45:32,396
[Lily] Take care.

610
00:45:32,813 --> 00:45:33,605
[Jepoy] Let's go.

611
00:45:42,990 --> 00:45:44,908
[car engine starting]

612
00:45:45,492 --> 00:45:47,494
-Let's go too.
-Lily…

613
00:45:48,579 --> 00:45:49,496
Mom.

614
00:45:52,458 --> 00:45:53,667
Lily.

615
00:45:54,793 --> 00:45:56,670
Even though I want to stop you,

616
00:45:56,753 --> 00:45:58,922
I already know you've made up your mind.

617
00:45:59,673 --> 00:46:01,216
So, I'll be praying for you.

618
00:46:01,300 --> 00:46:02,593
Thank you, Mom.

619
00:46:02,676 --> 00:46:05,095
[dramatic music playing]

620
00:46:12,686 --> 00:46:15,272
[Damian] <i>I shouldn't</i>
<i>swear to protect just Camia.</i>

621
00:46:16,190 --> 00:46:18,609
<i>I have to help Lily and Diego too.</i>

622
00:46:21,987 --> 00:46:24,948
-Please be careful.
-I will, Mom.

623
00:46:25,032 --> 00:46:27,201
And, I promise I'll come back to you.

624
00:46:27,784 --> 00:46:29,286
You should get back inside.

625
00:46:29,369 --> 00:46:30,537
Uncle Damian…

626
00:46:32,164 --> 00:46:34,291
please take care of my mother.

627
00:46:36,585 --> 00:46:37,753
-Diego.
-Auntie.

628
00:46:41,381 --> 00:46:42,508
Bye, Mom.

629
00:46:49,806 --> 00:46:50,891
Are you ready?

630
00:46:55,103 --> 00:46:58,023
I'd fight all alone if I could.

631
00:47:01,652 --> 00:47:03,362
[sighs] I wouldn't let you.

632
00:47:04,446 --> 00:47:05,739
From now on,

633
00:47:05,822 --> 00:47:09,243
we'll face every single challenge
in our lives together.

634
00:47:10,827 --> 00:47:12,788
I'll always be by your side.

635
00:47:16,917 --> 00:47:18,544
You're right, Diego.

636
00:47:20,754 --> 00:47:22,965
We'll face everything together.

637
00:47:25,133 --> 00:47:26,885
Just the two of us.

638
00:47:29,555 --> 00:47:30,847
So no matter what happens,

639
00:47:32,724 --> 00:47:35,060
always remember how much I love you.

640
00:47:40,649 --> 00:47:42,150
I love you too, Diego.

641
00:47:43,151 --> 00:47:45,320
[romantic music playing]

642
00:48:08,260 --> 00:48:10,012
[Emilia] <i>I'll make sure</i>
<i>that even the devil himself</i>

643
00:48:10,095 --> 00:48:12,681
<i>won't be able to find</i>
<i>or steal your fortune.</i>

644
00:48:12,764 --> 00:48:13,682
<i>Very good.</i>

645
00:48:13,765 --> 00:48:15,851
<i>Now get me my money.</i>

646
00:48:15,934 --> 00:48:19,354
[Diego] <i>Isn't that Magbanua?</i>
<i>What are Julio's men doing here?</i>

647
00:48:19,438 --> 00:48:21,940
[Lily] <i>Diego, we can't let the Ardientes</i>

648
00:48:22,024 --> 00:48:23,191
<i>take Helena's fortune first.</i>

649
00:48:23,275 --> 00:48:24,735
[Arnaldo] <i>By the way, where's Lily?</i>

650
00:48:24,818 --> 00:48:27,988
<i>They said they would take down</i>
<i>all of Red Dragon's businesses.</i>

651
00:48:28,071 --> 00:48:30,324
<i>They'll try to look</i>
<i>for her hidden wealth too.</i>

652
00:48:30,407 --> 00:48:31,950
[Lily] <i>That's where Red Dragon</i>
<i>hides her fortune.</i>

653
00:48:32,034 --> 00:48:32,993
[man] <i>Looks like we have visitors.</i>

654
00:48:33,076 --> 00:48:34,453
<i>We should get more men.</i>

655
00:48:34,536 --> 00:48:35,412
<i>No need.</i>

656
00:48:35,495 --> 00:48:38,081
<i>It's time to give them my little surprise.</i>

657
00:48:38,165 --> 00:48:40,959
-[Lily screams]
-[alarms blaring]

658
00:48:41,043 --> 00:48:43,378
[theme music playing]
